WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.200
It's been a weird time in the months leading
up to the release of Avengers 4.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.890
When fans haven't been sobbing over the events
of Avengers: Infinity War, they've been crafting

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:14.350
intricate theories about how the surviving
crew might find a way to reverse Thanos' universe-decimating

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.440
snap and bring our fallen Marvel favorites
back to life.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:22.180
Though it's a lovely thought that the turned-to-dust
gang will return, it may not actually come

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:22.880
to fruition.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:27.520
According to Scarlet Witch actress Elizabeth
Olsen, things aren't going to get better in

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.400
Avengers 4.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:33.600
Speaking at ACE Comic-Con in Chicago, Olsen
offered a blunt warning about the future of

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.940
Earth's Mightiest Heroes:

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.120
"It's only going to get worse."

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.390
Loki actor Tom Hiddleston joined Olsen on
stage for the convention panel, during which

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:45.730
he noted that both his character and Olsen's
Scarlet Witch had to make the ultimate sacrifice

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:48.640
in Infinity War, trading a life for the greater
good.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.100
Speaking to Olsen, he said:

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:55.220
"The thing you have to do at the end of Infinity
War is a kind of sacrifice, and arguably Loki

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:56.340
makes a similar one."

00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:01.180
As fans will recall, Loki died in the very
first scene of the film after trying to trick

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:01.680
Thanos.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.740
"No resurrections this time."

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:15.100
Scarlet Witch's sacrifice came at the end,
when she had to kill Vision in order to extract

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.400
the Mind Stone from his forehead and destroy
it.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:22.260
To make matters even more devastating, Scarlet
Witch didn't even survive Infinity War.

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:26.360
After killing her true love and then seeing
him die a second time, she floated away into

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:29.040
space dust, completely erased from reality.

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:33.760
The upside to Olsen's grim comments here is
that both she and Hiddleston will appear in

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:37.840
Avengers 4 in some capacity, despite biting
the dust in Infinity War.

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:42.440
Insiders previously spotted Olsen in Atlanta,
Georgia, filming reshoots for Avengers 4.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:46.520
The actress herself also shared a since-deleted
post to her Instagram story that revealed

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.380
a bruise she got while shooting the film.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:52.640
Olsen wrote in the caption of the photo that
the bruise came about while Scarlet Witch,

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:56.060
quote, "took flight," which suggests that
her character will be alive and well enough

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:59.980
to take to the skies for some epic action
sequences in the fourth Avengers flick.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:05.020
As for Hiddleston, he isn't 100-percent confirmed
for Avengers 4, but set photos have shown

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:09.220
him filming what looks to be a flashback or
time travel sequence for the film.

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:11.180
"Surprise."

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:14.519
It's hard to imagine that, after all the pain
the Avengers and co.

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:17.660
suffered in Infinity War, things are going
to get even bleaker.

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:22.040
But might the intense doom and gloom only
last a short while before the heroes taste

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:22.980
sweet success?

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:33.260
Fan theories have it that Avengers 4 will
feature time travel, with the surviving heroes

00:02:33.269 --> 00:02:37.269
banding together, taking a journey through
the Quantum Realm, and visiting the past to

00:02:37.269 --> 00:02:40.180
defeat Thanos before he can collect the Infinity
Stones.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:45.160
Leaked promotional art for Avengers 4 shows
Thor, Captain America, and Rocket Raccoon

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:49.920
wearing silver-white, red, and black suits
— ones that look similar to the costume

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:54.040
Hank Pym wore when he was searching for Janet
Van Dyne in the Quantum Realm.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:59.000
Many have taken this as proof that Earth's
Mightiest Heroes will visit the past in Avengers

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:01.380
4, and will utilize the Quantum Realm to get
there.

00:03:01.629 --> 00:03:05.680
Additional pieces of evidence that support
the time travel theory are the photos of Captain

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:10.159
America, Ant-Man, Hulk, and Iron Man on the
Avengers 4 set, filming a scene that looks

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:13.400
a lot like the Battle of New York from 2012's
The Avengers.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:17.980
We've also seen leaked concept art that depicts
Captain America in what looks like his suit

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:22.799
from Captain America: Civil War and Black
Widow rocking red hair — the same shade

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:27.400
she wore in The Avengers and its sequels – rather
than the blonde bob she sported in Infinity

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:27.900
War.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:32.360
All this considered, it seems highly likely
that Avengers 4 will start off super dark

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:37.110
before it turns back the clock and takes a
trip to Big Apple for Thanos-versus-Avengers

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.560
Showdown: Round Two.

00:03:38.889 --> 00:03:43.260
With a little luck and a whole lot of butt-kicking,
maybe the heroes truly will be able to defeat

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:48.060
Thanos and revive their fellow vigilantes
so that everyone can live happily ever after.

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:51.340
Avengers 4 is set for release on May 3rd,
2019.

